<body lang=ZH-CN style='tab-interval:21.0pt'>

<div class=WordSection1>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
margin-left:0cm'><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>一、填空题<span lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:
0cm;line-height:14.4pt'><span class=17><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>1</span></span><span class=17><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>、网络数据采集的核心环节包括</span></span><span
class=17><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:
Calibri;font-weight:normal'>__________</span></span><span class=17><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>和</span></span><span
class=17><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:
Calibri;font-weight:normal'>__________</span></span><span class=17><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>，其中前者负责建立与目标服务器的连接，后者负责提取所需数据。</span></span><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
margin-left:0cm'><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>答案： 连接建立； 数据提取 <span
lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:
0cm;line-height:14.4pt'><span class=17><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>2</span></span><span class=17><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>、常用的网络数据采集工具中，</span></span><span
class=17><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:
Calibri;font-weight:normal'>__________</span></span><span class=17><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>适合简单静态页面采集，</span></span><span
class=17><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:
Calibri;font-weight:normal'>__________</span></span><span class=17><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>支持动态页面爬取，可模拟浏览器渲染行为。</span></span><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
margin-left:0cm'><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>答案： </span><span lang=EN-US
style='font-size:10.5pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri'>requests</span><span
style='font-size:10.5pt'>； </span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri'>Selenium</span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt'> <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:
0cm;line-height:14.4pt'><span class=17><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
