<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
margin-left:0cm'><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>二、名词解释<span lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:
0cm;line-height:14.4pt'><span class=17><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>1</span></span><span class=17><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>、网络数据采集</span></span><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
margin-left:0cm'><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>答案：指通过一定的技术手段，从互联网网页、接口等数据源中获取所需数据的过程，核心环节包括连接建立、数据提取与存储，是数据预处理的基础步骤。<span
lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:
0cm;line-height:14.4pt'><span class=17><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>2</span></span><span class=17><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>、<span lang=EN-US>Kafka</span>主题</span></span><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
margin-left:0cm'><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>答案：<span lang=EN-US> Kafka</span>中用于存储消息的逻辑容器，是消息的分类集合，生产者将消息发送到指定主题，消费者从主题中读取消息，实现消息的分类管理与分发。<span
lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:
0cm;line-height:14.4pt'><span class=17><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>3</span></span><span class=17><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>、<span lang=EN-US>Canal</span></span></span><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
margin-left:0cm'><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>答案： 一款开源的实时数据库采集工具，核心原理是模拟<span
lang=EN-US>MySQL</span>从库（<span lang=EN-US>Slave</span>），监听<span lang=EN-US>MySQL</span>的二进制日志，捕获数据库的插入、更新、删除等变更操作，并将变更数据同步至指定目的地。<span
lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:
0cm;line-height:14.4pt'><span class=17><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>4</span></span><span class=17><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>、<span lang=EN-US>ELK</span>日志采集技术<span
class=GramE>栈</span></span></span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
margin-left:0cm'><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>答案： 由<span lang=EN-US>Elasticsearch</span>、<span
lang=EN-US>Logstash</span>、<span lang=EN-US>Kibana</span>三款工具组成的日志采集与分析体系，三者协同实现日志的采集、转发、存储、检索与可视化分析。<span
lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:
0cm;line-height:14.4pt'><span class=17><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>5</span></span><span class=17><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>、<span lang=EN-US>Kettle</span>转换</span></span><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
margin-left:0cm'><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>答案：<span lang=EN-US>Kettle</span>工具的核心组件之一，用于定义数据的输入、清洗、转换与输出逻辑，是实现数据处理的最小执行单元，可完成单一的数据处理任务。<span
lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:
0cm;line-height:14.4pt'><span class=15><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>6</span></span><span class=15><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>、动态网页采集</span></span><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
margin-left:0cm'><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>答案：针对采用<span lang=EN-US>JavaScript</span>等技术动态生成内容的网页进行数据采集的方式，需借助<span
lang=EN-US>Selenium</span>等工具模拟浏览器渲染行为，获取动态加载的目标数据。<span lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:
0cm;line-height:14.4pt'><span class=15><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>7</span></span><span class=15><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>、<span lang=EN-US>Kafka</span>分区</span></span><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
margin-left:0cm'><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>答案：<span lang=EN-US>Kafka</span>主题的细分单元，是消息的实际存储载体，一个主题可包含多个分区，实现消息的分片存储与并行处理，提升消息读写效率。<span
lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:
0cm;line-height:14.4pt'><span class=15><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>8</span></span><span class=15><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>、<span lang=EN-US>Maxwell</span></span></span><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
margin-left:0cm'><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>答案：一款轻量级的实时数据库变更采集工具，基于<span
lang=EN-US>MySQL</span>的二进制日志解析数据库变更数据，支持将变更数据发送至<span lang=EN-US>Kafka</span>、<span
lang=EN-US>Redis</span>等消息中间件，配置简单、部署便捷。<span lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:
0cm;line-height:14.4pt'><span class=15><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>9</span></span><span class=15><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>、<span lang=EN-US>Elasticsearch</span></span></span><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
margin-left:0cm'><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>答案：<span lang=EN-US>ELK</span>技术<span
class=GramE>栈</span>的核心组件，一款分布式全文检索与分析引擎，主要用于存储日志数据，支持全文检索、聚合分析等功能，为日志分析提供高效的数据查询能力。<span
lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:
0cm;line-height:14.4pt'><span class=15><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>10</span></span><span class=15><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>、<span lang=EN-US>Kettle</span>作业</span></span><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
margin-left:0cm'><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>答案：<span lang=EN-US>Kettle</span>工具中用于定义数据处理流程的组件，可管理多个转换，设置执行顺序、依赖关系与触发条件，实现复杂的数据处理流程调度。<span
lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-indent:0cm;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list 0cm'><![if !supportLists]><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt'><span style='mso-list:Ignore'>三、</span></span><![endif]><span
style='font-size:10.5pt'>简答题<span lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
margin-left:0cm'><span class=17><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>1</span></span><span class=17><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>、简述网络数据采集的核心流程，至少包含<span
lang=EN-US>3</span>个关键环节。</span></span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
margin-left:0cm'><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>答案：网络数据采集的核心流程：① 准备阶段：确定数据源、明确采集目标与需求；②
连接建立：通过<span lang=EN-US>HTTP</span>等协议与目标服务器建立连接；③ 数据提取：使用采集工具（如<span
lang=EN-US>requests</span>、<span lang=EN-US>Selenium</span>）提取目标数据；④ 数据清洗（可选）：去除冗余、错误数据；⑤
数据存储：将采集到的数据保存至数据库或文件中。<span lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:
0cm;line-height:14.4pt'><span class=17><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>2</span></span><span class=17><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>、简述<span lang=EN-US>Kafka</span>的核心组件及其各自的主要功能。</span></span><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
margin-left:0cm'><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>答案：<span lang=EN-US> Kafka</span>核心组件及功能：①
生产者：负责发送消息至<span lang=EN-US>Kafka</span>主题；② 主题：用于分类存储消息的逻辑容器；③ 分区：主题的细分单元，实现消息分片存储与并行处理；④
消费者：从主题中读取并消费消息；⑤ 消费者组：由多个消费者组成，共同消费一个主题的消息，提升消费效率。<span lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:
0cm;line-height:14.4pt'><span class=17><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>3</span></span><span class=17><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>、简述<span lang=EN-US>Canal</span>的工作原理，核心步骤是什么？</span></span><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
margin-left:0cm'><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>答案：<span lang=EN-US>Canal</span>工作原理核心步骤：①
模拟<span lang=EN-US>MySQL</span>从库，向<span lang=EN-US>MySQL</span>主库发送同步请求；② 监听<span
lang=EN-US>MySQL</span>的二进制日志，捕获数据库的插入、更新、删除等变更操作；③ 解析二进制日志中的变更数据，转换为指定格式（默认<span
lang=EN-US>JSON</span>）；④ 将解析后的变更数据同步至<span lang=EN-US>Kafka</span>、<span
lang=EN-US>Redis</span>等指定目的地。<span lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:
0cm;line-height:14.4pt'><span class=17><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>4</span></span><span class=17><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>、简述<span lang=EN-US>ELK</span>日志采集技术<span
class=GramE>栈</span>的组成及各组件的核心作用。</span></span><span lang=EN-US
style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
margin-left:0cm'><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>答案：<span lang=EN-US>ELK</span>组件及核心作用：①<span
lang=EN-US> Elasticsearch</span>：分布式全文检索引擎，负责存储日志数据、支持全文检索与聚合分析；②<span
lang=EN-US> Logstash</span>：日志采集与转发工具，负责采集分散的日志，进行过滤、转换后转发至<span lang=EN-US>Elasticsearch</span>；③<span
lang=EN-US> Kibana</span>：日志可视化工具，负责将<span lang=EN-US>Elasticsearch</span>中的日志数据以图表形式展示，方便用户分析查询。<span
lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:
0cm;line-height:14.4pt'><span class=15><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>5</span></span><span class=15><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>、简述动态网页采集与静态网页采集的区别，以及各自适用的场景。</span></span><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
margin-left:0cm'><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>答案： 区别：① 静态网页采集：采集内容固定，无需模拟浏览器渲染，工具轻量（如<span
lang=EN-US>requests</span>），效率高；② 动态网页采集：内容由<span lang=EN-US>JavaScript</span>动态生成，需模拟浏览器渲染（如<span
lang=EN-US>Selenium</span>），效率略低。适用场景：静态网页采集适用于内容不随交互变化的网页（如静态新闻页）；动态网页采集适用于内容实时加载、需交互才能显示的网页（如电商商品列表页）。<span
lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:
0cm;line-height:14.4pt'><span class=15><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>6</span></span><span class=15><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>、简述<span lang=EN-US>Kafka</span>分区的作用及优势。</span></span><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
margin-left:0cm'><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>答案：<span lang=EN-US>Kafka</span>分区的作用及优势：作用是将主题中的消息分片存储，实现消息的并行读写与负载均衡。优势：①
提升读写效率，多个分区可同时处理消息；② 实现消息分片，便于海量消息的存储与管理；③ 支持水平扩展，可通过增加分区数量提升系统吞吐量。<span
lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:
0cm;line-height:14.4pt'><span class=15><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>7</span></span><span class=15><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>、简述<span lang=EN-US>Maxwell</span>与<span
lang=EN-US>Canal</span>的核心区别，各自的适用场景是什么？</span></span><span lang=EN-US
style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
margin-left:0cm'><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>答案：<span lang=EN-US>Maxwell</span>与<span
lang=EN-US>Canal</span>的核心区别及适用场景：① 区别：<span lang=EN-US>Canal</span>部署相对复杂，支持全量<span
lang=EN-US>+</span>增量同步，适合中大型项目；<span lang=EN-US>Maxwell</span>部署轻量、配置简单，仅支持增量同步，适合小型项目。②
适用场景：<span lang=EN-US>Canal</span>适用于对数据同步完整性要求高、数据量大的中大型系统；<span lang=EN-US>Maxwell</span>适用于小型项目、快速部署需求，对全量同步无要求的场景。<span
lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:
0cm;line-height:14.4pt'><span class=15><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>8</span></span><span class=15><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>、简述<span lang=EN-US>Kettle</span>中作业与转换的区别与联系。</span></span><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
margin-left:0cm'><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>答案：<span lang=EN-US>Kettle</span>作业与转换的区别与联系：①
区别：转换专注于单一数据处理任务（如数据清洗、转换），是最小执行单元；作业用于管理多个转换，设置执行顺序、依赖关系，实现复杂流程调度。② 联系：作业不能直接处理数据，需调用转换完成数据处理任务；转换可独立运行，也可被作业调用，二者协同实现复杂的数据预处理流程。<span
lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:12.0pt;
margin-left:0cm'><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>四、综合题<span lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:
0cm;line-height:14.4pt'><span class=17><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>1</span></span><span class=17><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>、某同学需采集某静态网页的文章内容，无需复杂操作，选择简单采集工具，写出<span
lang=EN-US>1</span>种合适的工具及<span lang=EN-US>2</span>个核心操作步骤。</span></span><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
margin-left:0cm'><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>答案： 工具：<span lang=EN-US>requests</span>。核心步骤：①
安装<span lang=EN-US>requests</span>库，发送<span lang=EN-US>HTTP</span>请求获取网页源码；② 解析源码，提取文章内容字段。<span
lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:
0cm;line-height:14.4pt'><span class=17><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>2</span></span><span class=17><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>、某系统每小时产生<span
lang=EN-US>10</span>万条日志，需通过<span lang=EN-US>Kafka</span>存储，要求部署简单，设计<span
lang=EN-US>1</span>个主题，说明应设置多少个分区及核心理由。</span></span><span lang=EN-US
style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
margin-left:0cm'><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>答案：分区设置：<span lang=EN-US>1</span>个分区。理由：每小时<span
lang=EN-US>10</span>万条日志，数据量小，<span lang=EN-US>1</span>个分区可满足需求，部署最简单，无需额外配置多分区。<span
lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:
0cm;line-height:14.4pt'><span class=17><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>3</span></span><span class=17><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>、已知<span lang=EN-US>Maxwell</span>采集<span
lang=EN-US>MySQL</span>数据的同步延迟为<span lang=EN-US>0.5</span>秒<span lang=EN-US>/</span>条，若某时刻有<span
lang=EN-US>80</span>条数据同时变更，请问同步完所有数据需要多少秒？写出计算过程。</span></span><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
margin-left:0cm'><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>答案：计算过程：同步时间<span lang=EN-US>=</span>单条延迟×数据条数<span
lang=EN-US>=0.5</span>秒<span lang=EN-US>/</span>条×<span lang=EN-US>80</span>条<span
lang=EN-US>=40</span>秒。<span lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:
0cm;line-height:14.4pt'><span class=17><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>4</span></span><span class=17><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>、某<span lang=EN-US>ELK</span>部署中，<span
lang=EN-US>Filebeat</span>每分钟采集<span lang=EN-US>300</span>条日志，<span lang=EN-US>Logstash</span>每分钟可处理<span
lang=EN-US>600</span>条日志，<span lang=EN-US>Elasticsearch</span>每分钟可存储<span
lang=EN-US>900</span>条日志，求该<span lang=EN-US>ELK</span><span class=GramE>栈</span>每分钟最多可采集并存储多少条日志？说明计算依据。</span></span><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
margin-left:0cm'><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>答案：计算依据：<span lang=EN-US>ELK</span><span
class=GramE>栈</span>处理能力由瓶颈组件决定，<span lang=EN-US>Filebeat</span>每分钟采集<span
lang=EN-US>300</span>条（最小），<span class=GramE>故最大</span>处理量由<span lang=EN-US>Filebeat</span>决定。<span
lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:12.0pt;
margin-left:0cm'><span class=17><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>5</span></span><span class=17><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>、<span lang=EN-US>Kettle</span>处理某批数据，每分钟可清洗<span
lang=EN-US>400</span>条数据，该批数据共有<span lang=EN-US>4800</span>条，清洗完成后需<span
lang=EN-US>1</span>分钟导出，求从开始清洗到导出完成共需多少分钟？写出计算过程。</span></span><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
margin-left:0cm'><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>答案：计算过程：总秒数<span lang=EN-US>=</span>总数据量÷每秒导入量<span
lang=EN-US>=1200</span>条÷<span lang=EN-US>30</span>条<span lang=EN-US>/</span>秒<span
lang=EN-US>=40</span>秒；换算为分钟<span lang=EN-US>=40</span>÷<span lang=EN-US>60</span>≈<span
lang=EN-US>0.67</span>分钟。<span lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:
0cm;line-height:14.4pt'><span class=15><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>6</span></span><span class=15><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>、采集静态网<span
class=GramE>页数据</span>时，为避免频繁请求被封禁，写出<span lang=EN-US>2</span>种简单易操作的反<span
class=GramE>反</span>爬方法，无需复杂配置。</span></span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
margin-left:0cm'><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>答案： 反<span class=GramE>反</span>爬方法：①
设置延时请求（每请求<span lang=EN-US>1</span>次间隔<span lang=EN-US>1-2</span>秒）；② 模拟浏览器请求头（添加<span
lang=EN-US>User-Agent</span>）。<span lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:
0cm;line-height:14.4pt'><span class=15><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>7</span></span><span class=15><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>、已知<span lang=EN-US>Kafka</span><span
class=GramE>某主题</span>有<span lang=EN-US>2</span>个分区，若有<span lang=EN-US>1</span>个消费者组成消费者组，说明该消费者<span
class=GramE>会消费</span>几个分区的消息及原因。</span></span><span lang=EN-US
style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
margin-left:0cm'><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>答案：消费分区数：<span lang=EN-US>2</span>个。原因：消费者组中消费者数量小于分区数量时，单个消费者<span
class=GramE>会消费</span>所有分区的消息，确保消息不遗漏。<span lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:
0cm;line-height:14.4pt'><span class=15><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>8</span></span><span class=15><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>、<span lang=EN-US>Canal</span>同步<span
lang=EN-US>MySQL</span>数据的速度为每秒<span lang=EN-US>120</span>条，若需同步<span
lang=EN-US>3600</span>条变更数据，且同步前准备时间为<span lang=EN-US>10</span>秒，求从准备到同步完成共需多少秒？写出计算过程。</span></span><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
margin-left:0cm'><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>答案：计算过程：同步数据时间<span lang=EN-US>=</span>总数据量÷每秒同步量<span
lang=EN-US>=3600</span>条÷<span lang=EN-US>120</span>条<span lang=EN-US>/</span>秒<span
lang=EN-US>=30</span>秒；总时间<span lang=EN-US>=</span>准备时间<span lang=EN-US>+</span>同步时间<span
lang=EN-US>=10</span>秒<span lang=EN-US>+30</span>秒<span lang=EN-US>=40</span>秒。<span
lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:
0cm;line-height:14.4pt'><span class=15><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>9</span></span><span class=15><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>、<span class=GramE>某应用</span>服务器每小时产生<span
lang=EN-US>1800</span>条日志，使用<span lang=EN-US>ELK</span>采集存储，若<span lang=EN-US>Filebeat</span>每小时采集量是服务器日志量的<span
lang=EN-US>1.2</span>倍，求<span lang=EN-US>Filebeat</span>每小时可采集多少条日志？写出计算过程。</span></span><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
margin-left:0cm'><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>答案： 计算过程：<span lang=EN-US>Filebeat</span>每小时采集量<span
lang=EN-US>=</span>服务器日志量×<span lang=EN-US>1.2=1800</span>条×<span lang=EN-US>1.2=2160</span>条。<span
lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:
0cm;line-height:14.4pt'><span class=15><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>10</span></span><span class=15><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal'>、<span lang=EN-US>Kettle</span>处理某批数据，每分钟可清洗<span
lang=EN-US>400</span>条数据，该批数据共有<span lang=EN-US>4800</span>条，清洗完成后需<span
lang=EN-US>1</span>分钟导出，求从开始清洗到导出完成共需多少分钟？写出计算过程。</span></span><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
margin-left:0cm'><span style='font-size:10.5pt'>答案：计算过程：清洗时间<span lang=EN-US>=</span>总数据量÷每分钟清洗量<span
lang=EN-US>=4800</span>条÷<span lang=EN-US>400</span>条<span lang=EN-US>/</span>分钟<span
lang=EN-US>=12</span>分钟；总时间<span lang=EN-US>=</span>清洗时间<span lang=EN-US>+</span>导出时间<span
lang=EN-US>=12</span>分钟<span lang=EN-US>+1</span>分钟<span lang=EN-US>=13</span>分钟。<span
lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

